      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- So we know that Databases would perform a lot\n  better with Block Storage\n- And Block Storage would be an example of :\n\n    ° Read Write Once Storage",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- So we know that Databases would perform a lot\n  better with Block Storage\n- And Block Storage would be an example of :\n\n    ° Read Write Once Storage",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "created": 1790262016818,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
